<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss launch 3-month money market claims.</title>
<headline>Swiss launch 3-month money market claims.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is issuing three-month money market claims to be paid for on November 28, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The allocation follows the end of subscriptions on November 26.</p>
<p>The previous issue of three-month claims, paid for on November 21, raised 966.15 million francs and was priced at 99.590 percent to yield 1.629 percent annually.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
